They're here!


00:33:10.096 --> 00:33:11.791
It's okay.


00:33:28.448 --> 00:33:30.541
What are you doing,
running away from me?


00:33:30.617 --> 00:33:32.380
I've been looking
for you for 10 minutes.


00:33:32.452 --> 00:33:34.352
Come on, it's starting
to snow again.


00:33:34.421 --> 00:33:36.787
You're gonna get
totally snowed on.


00:33:37.824 --> 00:33:39.223
Hurry up.


00:33:53.673 --> 00:33:56.198
If you think I'm going
in there, I'm not.


00:33:56.276 --> 00:33:58.107
It's creepy.


00:33:58.178 --> 00:34:00.078
All right.
You're right,


00:34:00.146 --> 00:34:02.137
but at least
you'll be nice and dry.


00:34:13.359 --> 00:34:14.951
Hey.


00:34:17.063 --> 00:34:19.122
Welcome home, honey.


00:34:19.199 --> 00:34:21.190
What do you think?


00:34:21.267 --> 00:34:23.701
What am I supposed
to think?


00:34:23.770 --> 00:34:26.500
That it's
kinda cool in here.


00:34:28.041 --> 00:34:30.134
I suppose so.


00:34:30.210 --> 00:34:32.337
I love this place.


00:34:33.546 --> 00:34:35.013
Admit you didn't
know about it.


00:34:35.081 --> 00:34:37.481
Admit it was
a good surprise.


00:34:37.550 --> 00:34:41.452
Sometimes I think you forget
that we're from the same town.


00:34:42.889 --> 00:34:46.416
- So?
- So I know all the same places.


00:34:46.493 --> 00:34:48.518
I know
all the same things.


00:34:48.595 --> 00:34:50.529
I know your family.


00:34:50.597 --> 00:34:52.497
You know my father.


00:34:52.565 --> 00:34:54.556
We work
at the same company.


00:34:54.634 --> 00:34:57.831
- L...
- I'm not sure I'm following.


00:34:59.005 --> 00:35:01.132
Don't you ever
wanna leave?


00:35:04.244 --> 00:35:06.371
It's always the same...


00:35:06.446 --> 00:35:08.346
same faces,
same streets,


00:35:08.414 --> 00:35:10.211
same everything.


00:35:20.059 --> 00:35:22.027
The snow is
beautiful, huh?


00:35:24.597 --> 00:35:26.360
You know what
it reminds me of?


00:35:26.432 --> 00:35:28.798
The day you won
your medal.


00:35:28.868 --> 00:35:30.802
I couldn't find
the place.


00:35:30.870 --> 00:35:33.566
Everybody was there
to see you dancing.


00:35:33.640 --> 00:35:35.608
I had to watch
from outside.


00:35:35.675 --> 00:35:37.438
I mean you didn't
see me, but...


00:35:38.678 --> 00:35:40.839
I was there.


00:35:40.914 --> 00:35:42.814
I clapped


00:35:42.882 --> 00:35:44.941
and I was frozen.


00:35:46.186 --> 00:35:48.711
I haven't been
that happy in a long time.


00:35:48.788 --> 00:35:50.983
Right. I get it.


00:35:51.057 --> 00:35:53.685
It's a little
birthday depression.


00:35:55.061 --> 00:35:57.757
What's life
to you, David?


00:35:59.365 --> 00:36:01.390
What do you think?


00:36:02.502 --> 00:36:04.527
That everything
is free will


00:36:04.604 --> 00:36:07.004
or that things are
written for us?


00:36:09.709 --> 00:36:12.075
Where do you see yourself
in 20 years?


00:36:13.813 --> 00:36:16.714
Aren't you afraid you're gonna make
all the wrong choices?


00:36:16.783 --> 00:36:19.308
A job that... that
you don't really like


00:36:19.385 --> 00:36:20.909
that doesn't really
make you happy?


00:36:20.987 --> 00:36:24.354
Getting married to somebody
that you don't really love?


00:36:25.858 --> 00:36:28.122
I don't wanna
live that way.


00:36:32.131 --> 00:36:33.462
Look...


00:36:35.802 --> 00:36:38.202
I don't know
what kind of guy


00:36:38.271 --> 00:36:41.968
I'm gonna be
in 20 years from now...


00:36:46.613 --> 00:36:48.945
but I know that you mean
a lot to your father.


00:36:51.417 --> 00:36:53.908
You mean a lot to those kids
you look after.


00:37:01.594 --> 00:37:03.221
You mean
a lot to me.


00:37:06.966 --> 00:37:08.763
Alice.


00:37:11.137 --> 00:37:13.230
Happy birthday.


00:37:14.874 --> 00:37:16.432
David.


00:37:19.045 --> 00:37:20.876
I'm sorry.


00:37:46.906 --> 00:37:49.534
How... how did
you get in here?


00:37:51.511 --> 00:37:54.537
Uh, by the window.


00:37:55.581 --> 00:37:58.914
No, inside the fort.


00:38:00.086 --> 00:38:01.576
How did you get
inside the fort?


00:38:03.356 --> 00:38:05.256
The gate...
the main gate.


00:38:08.895 --> 00:38:11.659
The... the drawbridge
has been put back?


00:38:11.731 --> 00:38:15.326
What? Right,
the drawbridge.


00:38:17.970 --> 00:38:22.407
The main gate,
is it far from here?


00:38:22.475 --> 00:38:25.911
Uh, 400 yards.


00:38:27.313 --> 00:38:31.010
You... you...
you take her,


00:38:31.084 --> 00:38:34.144
you both
get out of here.


00:38:34.220 --> 00:38:35.710
Go on. Move.


00:38:35.788 --> 00:38:38.313
Get out of here now.


00:38:39.992 --> 00:38:43.519
- Get the fuck out of here.
- Okay okay okay.


00:38:45.031 --> 00:38:47.693
Uh, let's go.


00:38:47.767 --> 00:38:49.564
Let's... let's go.


00:38:56.676 --> 00:38:59.110
Jesus.
You saw that guy.


00:38:59.178 --> 00:39:01.703
- From the park the other day.
- Yeah, I remember.


00:39:01.781 --> 00:39:04.181
Whoever he is, he's armed.
We gotta split.


00:39:04.250 --> 00:39:06.650
- Okay, let's...
- His face? It was totally smashed up.


00:39:06.719 --> 00:39:08.311
I know, I know,
I know. Come on.


00:39:08.388 --> 00:39:10.117
We've got to get to the car
and call the cops.


00:42:24.584 --> 00:42:26.643
- Okay.
- No.


00:43:52.605 --> 00:43:54.470
Oh fuck!


00:43:58.377 --> 00:44:00.208
God!


00:44:04.150 --> 00:44:08.086
No. No no.
Please, I'm hurt!


00:44:11.357 --> 00:44:14.690
I'm hurt!
Stop. Please.


00:44:54.633 --> 00:44:56.100
Alice.


00:44:59.205 --> 00:45:00.934
Alice.


00:45:03.109 --> 00:45:05.077
Get out of here.


00:45:06.612 --> 00:45:08.011
Just go.


00:45:12.351 --> 00:45:14.342
- Please.
- No.


00:45:17.256 --> 00:45:18.951
Just go.


00:46:31.430 --> 00:46:34.126
God damn it.


00:46:40.606 --> 00:46:41.732
God damn it.


00:49:47.026 --> 00:49:49.256
What is your name?

